    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13950" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσχάζω</span></b> , stronger form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχάζω, ἀ. φλέβα</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>open</i> a vein, <i><span class="en">
				Crates Com.
				41
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				514b2
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be lanced,</i> of a <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαργαρεών,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>scarify,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				7.18.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>let go,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχαστηρίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hero
					<u>Bel.</u>
					79.3
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>let go</i> a stage machine, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Aut.</u>
				20.4
			</span></i>.</div>
